THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution embeds and redistributes pre-compiled sBPF program
binaries that are the work of third parties. They are located in
crates/karstflow-control/src/programs/ and are linked into the binary at
compile time so that a node started from genesis has real on-chain program
code available.

All of them are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the same
